1
00:00:15,377 --> 00:00:18,933
I look into your eyes.

2
00:00:19,288 --> 00:00:22,933
They always saw through me.

3
00:00:23,066 --> 00:00:26,533
Tears fall down your face.

4
00:00:27,288 --> 00:00:30,933
They stain my red dress deep.

5
00:00:31,288 --> 00:00:34,399
Warm and dark and wet.

6
00:00:35,377 --> 00:00:38,622
They burn against my skin.

7
00:00:39,377 --> 00:00:42,755
I hold you closer still.

8
00:00:43,288 --> 00:00:46,266
I don’t want this to end.

9
00:00:47,155 --> 00:00:50,666
Your body starts to shake.

10
00:00:51,244 --> 00:00:54,711
Your breath comes hard and low.

11
00:00:55,288 --> 00:00:58,844
I feel your heart beat fast

12
00:00:59,288 --> 00:01:02,666
Against my chest, so slow.

13
00:01:03,155 --> 00:01:06,666
I press my face to yours.

14
00:01:07,155 --> 00:01:10,799
I smell the salt and skin.

15
00:01:11,377 --> 00:01:14,755
You hold me like you’ll break.

16
00:01:15,199 --> 00:01:18,844
I hold you tighter in.

17
00:01:20,222 --> 00:01:23,155
I love you, stay with me.

18
00:01:23,298 --> 00:01:27,476
Don’t let me go tonight.

19
00:01:28,055 --> 00:01:31,299
The words scream in my head.

20
00:01:31,309 --> 00:01:35,221
But I can’t get them right.

21
00:01:35,289 --> 00:01:39,023
They burn inside my mouth.

22
00:01:39,077 --> 00:01:42,722
They kick against my ribs.

23
00:01:43,265 --> 00:01:46,154
I want to say it all.

24
00:01:47,155 --> 00:01:50,755
But silence keeps its grip.

25
00:01:51,288 --> 00:01:54,844
A sudden cold slips in.

26
00:01:55,288 --> 00:01:58,533
It cuts between us both.

27
00:01:59,199 --> 00:02:02,622
You’re warm against my skin.

28
00:02:03,422 --> 00:02:06,755
But something else feels close.

29
00:02:07,066 --> 00:02:10,755
You feel it too, I know.

30
00:02:11,466 --> 00:02:14,977
The ground begins to shift.

31
00:02:15,288 --> 00:02:18,755
We had so much in hand.

32
00:02:19,244 --> 00:02:22,622
Now all of it just slips.

33
00:02:24,123 --> 00:02:27,012
I pull away from you.

34
00:02:27,111 --> 00:02:30,444
My face is wet and bright.

35
00:02:32,255 --> 00:02:35,188
I look you in the eyes

36
00:02:35,198 --> 00:02:39,287
Under the hall’s hard light.

37
00:02:56,544 --> 00:03:02,855
“Paul…” I say your name. My voice is soft and low.

38
00:03:03,211 --> 00:03:10,988
“You’re beautiful,” I breathe. “The finest man I know.”

39
00:03:11,166 --> 00:03:15,255
I put my hand right here,

40
00:03:15,309 --> 00:03:18,821
Above your beating heart.

41
00:03:19,255 --> 00:03:22,944
I feel the strength in you.

42
00:03:22,998 --> 00:03:27,132
It almost tears me apart.

43
00:03:27,467 --> 00:03:31,156
I try to speak the truth.

44
00:03:31,166 --> 00:03:34,633
My lips begin to move.

45
00:03:35,166 --> 00:03:38,455
The words get stuck again.

46
00:03:39,299 --> 00:03:43,655
They never make it through.

47
00:03:43,745 --> 00:03:47,034
I love you… stay with me…

48
00:03:47,222 --> 00:03:51,933
It screams inside my head.

49
00:03:52,076 --> 00:03:56,609
My hand falls from your chest.

50
00:03:58,066 --> 00:04:03,044
And then… I’m gone...

51
00:04:07,488 --> 00:04:10,822
I’m gone...

